                "text": "<p>Luxury properties in Chennai can be found in several of its upscale neighbourhoods. Premium localities that are renowned for their luxury property offerings include Alwarpet, Boat Club, Poes Garden and Nungambakkam. These areas frequently offer properties with premium amenities and high-value price tags. Be sure to engage the services of a reputable real estate agent or property expert for accurate listings within these areas.<\/p>\r\n"
            }
        }
    ],
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "@context": "https://schema.org"
}
     </script>
    
  </section>
</div>
